id=calld
name=calld supervisor
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=rivavolt
description=Supervises the call daemon as root (calld self-drops to uid 2000 keeping audio+inet): restarts on exit with backoff, waits for the tailnet address before start and recycles whenever the address is present but unserved, SIGTERM+grace shutdown. Idle until /data/local/tmp/calld.enabled exists, so installing this is safe.
